# Phase 1: Grammar Foundations

## 1. Parts of Speech

## Complete Learning Guide

Welcome to your comprehensive grammar foundations guide! This phase is the bedrock of your English mastery. By the end of this guide, you'll have a solid understanding of every part of speech and how they work together to form clear, correct sentences.

